d-to-Gain report displayed with or without filters\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-21.1\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The browser download list contains a file in the selected format with the displayed report data\",\n  \"when\": \"The user selects CSV or PDF export\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-22\",\n  \"given\": \"Mock demo data and presentation content are available\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-22.1\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen shows sample operational data and sections for the proposed solution, architecture diagrams, demo flow, coding super prompt and other prompts, testing and validation, challenges, production readiness, and go-to-market analysis\",\n  \"when\": \"A user opens or reviews the demo and presentation view\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"approved-screens\" kind=\"approved-screens\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"screen\": \"S-2\",\n  \"route\": \"/overview\",\n  \"reqs\": [\n   \"REQ-18\"\n  ],\n  \"states\": [],\n  \"title\": \"Overview\",\n  \"buttons\": [],\n  \"fields\": [],\n  \"columns\": [\n   \"Lot\",\n   \"Pen\",\n   \"Head\",\n   \"ADG (lb/day)\",\n   \"FCR\",\n   \"Cost of Gain\",\n   \"Feed Cost\",\n   \"Rank\",\n   \"Type / Breed\",\n   \"Days on Feed\",\n   \"Latest Weight\",\n   \"ADG\",\n   \"Ingredient\",\n   \"Closing (lb)\",\n   \"Daily Demand\",\n   \"Date\",\n   \"Target\",\n   \"Rate & Total\",\n   \"Status\",\n   \"Time\"\n  ],\n  \"messages\": {},\n  \"toasts\": []\n },\n {\n  \"screen\": \"S-12\",\n  \"route\": \"/yard-summary\",\n  \"reqs\": [\n   \"REQ-19\"\n  ],\n  \"states\": [],\n  \"title\": \"Yard summary\",\n  \"buttons\": [],\n  \"fields\": [],\n  \"columns\": [\n   \"Average ADG\",\n   \"Average Cost of Gain\",\n   \"Total Feed Cost\",\n   \"Active Lots\",\n   \"Active Pens\",\n   \"Pen Capacity & Occupancy\",\n   \"Lot\",\n   \"Pen Location\",\n   \"Breed & Sex\",\n   \"Head Count\",\n   \"Head Share\",\n   \"Days on Feed\",\n   \"ADG (lb/day)\",\n   \"FCR\",\n   \"Cost of Gain\",\n   \"Feed Cost Contrib